    <string name="about_body">CouchZap is a native, open-source IPTV player for Android TV, TV boxes and Android phones, released under the MIT license.

Use your own playlist or optionally choose public playlists from iptv-org and Free-TV. Stream availability can change.

Your playlists, favourites and settings stay on your device. Explore the source code and contribute on GitHub.</string>
